====== Orange Pi R1 (H2+) ======

For further Allwinner-based boards, please refer to [[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.allwinner.sunxi|soc.allwinner.sunxi]]

==== Availability ====

The board is available from various vendors, including the manufacturer itself, see [[http://www.orangepi.org/|here for Orange Pi R1]].

Further details on the board: http://linux-sunxi.org/Orange_Pi_R1


