==== Installation process ====

Please refer to [[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.allwinner.sunxi#installing_openwrt|soc.allwinner.sunxi]]. The usual SD-card image will be built.


===== Hardware =====

==== Serial ====

You can use your usual serial levelshifter. Pinout is printed on the board, near the power connector.

